DESCRIPTION:Dir. Motonori Sakakibara · 47 min\n\nWhen a giant T-Rex threat
 ens Hot Wheels City\, it's up to Coop and his friends to race to the rescu
 e and save the day.\n\nTickets: https://tickets.omsi.edu/events/018fd064-d
 d58-14dc-ed5c-dd617dc15720\n\nMore showtimes: https://mattlohkamp.github.i
 o/small-screens-pdx/
